---
import BlockStack from "~/components/block-stack.astro";
import FeatureList from "~/components/blocks/feature-list.astro";
import PageIntro from "~/components/blocks/page-intro.astro";
import Story from "~/components/blocks/story.astro";
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/base-layout.astro";

const subheading =
  "I'm Trevor – a full-stack developer who took the long way here, and is better for it.";
---

<BaseLayout description={subheading} title="About">
  <BlockStack>
    <PageIntro
      eyebrow="About"
      heading="From the kitchen to the codebase"
      subheading={subheading}
    />
    <Story>
      <p>
        For years, my workplace was a Michelin-starred professional kitchen. It
        taught me to work under pressure, to care about details nobody else
        notices, and that a hundred small things done right add up to something
        people remember. Those lessons didn't stay in the kitchen.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I dove into software development, it clicked – the same craft of
        mise en place, timing, and consistency mapped straight onto building for
        the web. I taught myself to code, then went deep: the interface, the
        server, the data underneath, and the deploy at the end.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm still the person who sweats the details. I just do it in a codebase
        now.
      </p>
    </Story>
    <FeatureList
      heading="What I value"
      items={[
        {
          description:
            "The kitchen taught me that the details are the work. I sweat them.",
          title: "Craft",
        },
        {
          description:
            "Clear communication and dependable delivery. Every time.",
          title: "Reliability",
        },
        {
          description:
            "There's always a better way to do it. I keep looking for it.",
          title: "Curiosity",
        },
      ]}
    />
    <FeatureList
      heading="How I work"
      items={[
        {
          description:
            "I start by understanding the goal, then work in small, reviewable steps.",
          title: "Ship in small steps",
        },
        {
          description:
            "I keep you in the loop and make the trade-offs visible as we go.",
          title: "Communicate Openly",
        },
        {
          description:
            "I care about the handoff – clean code, clear docs, easy to maintain.",
          title: "Leave it better",
        },
      ]}
    />
  </BlockStack>
</BaseLayout>
